cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PhasorFlow in your research, please cite both the software and the accompanying paper."
title: "PhasorFlow: A Python Library for Unit Circle Based Computing"
abstract: >-
  PhasorFlow is a unit-circle (phasor) computing framework for Python. It
  provides Variational Phasor Circuits, a DFT-based Phasor Transformer, a
  library of phasor gates, and analytic and vectorized execution engines for
  phase-native machine learning and signal processing.
